# What never goes into the build context of .github/isolation/Dockerfile.
#
# `.git` is deliberately absent from this list. Two tests in the suite derive
# what they are about from `git ls-files`, so an image without the repository
# would fail them for a reason that is not what the container is proving.
#
# Everything below is either a local environment, a build product or a cache. A
# virtual environment built on one operating system and copied into a Linux
# image is the worst of them: it would shadow the interpreter the image pins
# with binaries that cannot run there.
.venv/
venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
